/S /H1
/T (1. Autonomy An agent is an autonomous, interactive, goal-driven entity with its own state, behavior, and decision-making capabilities. It has the capability of self-improvement when it sees that it is unable to meet the performance parameters for reaching its goal. Example: An Agentic Chatbot adapts its conversational tone and logic based on user feedback, refining responses to better align with the user's intent over time.)
/E (1. Autonomy An agent is an autonomous, interactive, goal-driven entity with its own state, behavior, and decision-making capabilities. It has the capability of self-improvement when it sees that it is unable to meet the performance parameters for reaching its goal. Example: An Agentic Chatbot adapts its conversational tone and logic based on user feedback, refining responses to better align with the user's intent over time.)
