/T ( 5. Constitution An agent needs to adhere to some regulations and policies depending on the imperatives of its task and goals. It needs to protect itself from being compromised or destroyed as well as be trusted not to harm other agents sharing the environment in which it is operating. Example: The chatbot complies with privacy regulations by anonymizing sensitive user data and ensures that it avoids generating harmful or biased responses. )
/E ( 5. Constitution An agent needs to adhere to some regulations and policies depending on the imperatives of its task and goals. It needs to protect itself from being compromised or destroyed as well as be trusted not to harm other agents sharing the environment in which it is operating. Example: The chatbot complies with privacy regulations by anonymizing sensitive user data and ensures that it avoids generating harmful or biased responses. )
